Package: bigtenperf
Title: Tools for Big Ten Football Performance Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jaxon", "Hill", email = "jaxonhill21@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Imports cached PFF college football season extracts and prepares
    player- and team-level offensive grades for analysis. Includes a
    school-season dataset of Big Ten football roster profiles for 2014 to
    2026.
